    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit customer support, my name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690564333332
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 46110,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690571666665
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Could you please provide your name or order number so I can pull up your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690573666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Sterling. Order 788-B45.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 46110,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690581399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Sterling. One moment... Okay, I see your order for the VeloFit Aero jersey. I also see you're one of our VIP members, so thank you for your loyalty. What seems to be the issue with the jersey?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690583533331
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 46110,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690597533331
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. And just to be clear, is it a technical fault with the material or more of a preference issue with the fit?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690599066664
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just too tight. It's the wrong size, like I said.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 46110,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690607333330
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. My apologies. I see the delivery was about 12 days ago. For a standard item like this jersey, you are well within our 90-day return policy. We can absolutely get this sorted. Would you prefer a full refund, or would you like to exchange it for a different size?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690611133330
    },
    {
      "text": "An exchange, I guess. Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 46110,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690629466663
    },
    {
      "text": "Great! I can set up that exchange right away. And as a thank you for being a VIP member, I'll waive the return shipping fee and get the replacement sent out with complimentary expedited shipping. What size would you like instead?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690631466663
    },
    {
      "text": "Large. Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
