      "user_id": 46110,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768690646933329
    },
    {
      "text": "Excellent. I've just processed the exchange for a size Large. You'll receive a confirmation email shortly, along with a prepaid return label for the original jersey. Just drop that in the mail within the next week. Is there anything else I can help with today, Mr. Sterling?",
